---
// /jewellery-consultation: end-to-end consultation for retail jewellers.
// Photos in /public/jewellery-consultation: hero = showroom front render supplied by the user; store-setup, telecalling,
// outdoor-marketing, team-meeting, team-discussion (Unsplash) are free-licence stock;
// launch-event, staff, customers and venkat-founder are Canny Heads' own photos.
const wa='https://wa.me/917200824009?text='+encodeURIComponent('Hello Canny Heads, I would like a jewellery business consultation.');
const groups=[
 {id:'store-setup',title:'New store setup',lead:'Start right: the location, the paperwork and the showroom itself.',image:'store-setup',alt:'Jewellery showroom with display counters',items:[
  ['Location evaluation','We identify and assess the right location for your new showroom: catchment, footfall, competition and visibility.'],
  ['Licensing & statutory formalities','Building and premises licensing and every permit required to start a jewellery business, handled in the right order.'],
  ['Showroom setup','Layout, counters, display, lighting and security planned for how jewellery is actually sold.']]},
 {id:'pre-launch',title:'Pre-launch marketing',lead:'Customers should know your name before the doors open.',image:'launch-event',alt:'Guests at a jewellery industry event',items:[
  ['Pre-opening campaigns','Marketing activities that build awareness and drive walk-ins before launch.'],
  ['Launch planning','Opening-day plan, offers, invitations and store opening activities.']]},
 {id:'manpower',title:'Manpower recruitment & training',lead:'The right people, trained to sell with confidence.',image:'staff',alt:'Appreciating showroom staff',items:[
  ['Showroom staff recruitment','Sales staff, cashiers and supervisors hired for your showroom.'],
  ['Product knowledge training','Gold, diamond and silver product knowledge your team can explain to customers.'],
  ['Selling skills training','Greeting, presenting, handling objections and closing the sale.']]},
 {id:'sops',title:'Process & SOPs',lead:'Clear systems so the showroom runs the same way every day.',items:[
  ['Complete showroom SOPs','Standard operating procedures for jewellery retail, from opening to closing.'],
  ['Staff uniforms','A uniform plan that fits your brand.'],
  ['Payroll & statutory compliance','Payroll system, ESI, PF and other statutory requirements set up correctly.']]},
 {id:'running',title:'Running-business support',lead:'Ongoing help to grow sales after the launch.',image:'customers',alt:'Welcoming customers at a jewellery showroom',items:[
  ['Day-to-day marketing','Regular local marketing activities that keep customers coming in.'],
  ['Social media promotions','Instagram and YouTube reels created for your showroom.'],
  ['Website SEO','Website optimisation so local customers find you on Google.'],
  ['Merchandise planning','The right merchandise mix for your target customers and store location.'],
  ['Records & software','Record systems and jewellery software set up for your operations.'],
  ['Tele-calling systems','Structured customer follow-up and tele-calling routines.']]}];
const inAction=[['telecalling','Tele-calling','Structured customer calls and follow-ups'],['outdoor-marketing','Outdoor marketing','Field promotion that brings walk-ins'],['team-meeting','Team meetings','Daily briefings and clear targets'],['team-discussion','Team discussions','Solving problems together with your staff']];
---
<section class="jc-hero"><div class="wrap jc-hero-grid"><div><p class="kicker">Jewellery Business Consultation</p><h1>Expert jewellery retail business consultation.</h1><p class="intro">Backed by <b>20+ years of hands-on experience</b> in jewellery retail: complete end-to-end support, from store setup to daily running operations.</p><div class="actions"><a class="button jc-wa" href={wa}>WhatsApp us ↗</a><a class="button secondary" href="tel:+917200824009">Call 72008 24009</a><a class="text-link" href="#jc-enquiry">Send an enquiry ↓</a></div><ul class="jc-proof"><li><strong>20+</strong><span>years in jewellery retail</span></li><li><strong>5</strong><span>areas of support</span></li><li><strong>1</strong><span>partner, start to finish</span></li></ul></div><figure><img src="/jewellery-consultation/showroom-front-ch.webp" alt="Jewellery showroom front elevation with the Canny Heads logo: gold, silver and diamond" width="474" height="500" fetchpriority="high"/></figure></div></section>

<section class="wrap section jc-video"><video controls preload="none" playsinline poster="/jewellery-consultation/venkat-video-poster.webp" width="576" height="1024"><source src="/jewellery-consultation/venkat-jewellery-consultation.mp4" type="video/mp4"/>Your browser does not support this video.</video><div><p class="kicker">Hear from our founder</p><h2>Venkat on jewellery business consultation.</h2><p>A short message from Venkat, Founder &amp; CEO, about how we help jewellers set up and run successful showrooms. <span lang="ta" class="tamil-inline">(தமிழில்)</span></p><p class="small">34 seconds · Tap to play</p><div class="actions"><a class="button jc-wa" href={wa}>Talk to Venkat on WhatsApp ↗</a></div></div></section>

<nav class="wrap jc-index" aria-label="Services on this page">{groups.map((g,i)=><a href={'#'+g.id}><span>0{i+1}</span>{g.title}</a>)}</nav>

{groups.map((g,i)=><section id={g.id} class={'jc-group'+(i%2?' band':'')}><div class={'wrap'+(g.image?' jc-split'+(i%3===1?' flip':''):'')}><div><p class="kicker">Service 0{i+1}</p><h2>{g.title}</h2><p class="jc-lead">{g.lead}</p><div class={'jc-items'+(g.image?'':' wide')}>{g.items.map(([t,d])=><article><h3>{t}</h3><p>{d}</p></article>)}</div></div>{g.image&&<figure class="jc-photo"><img src={'/jewellery-consultation/'+g.image+'.webp'} alt={g.alt} width="900" height="600" loading="lazy"/></figure>}</div></section>)}

<section class="wrap section jc-action"><p class="kicker">Hands-on support</p><h2>Working alongside your team.</h2><div class="jc-action-grid">{inAction.map(([img,t,d])=><figure><img src={'/jewellery-consultation/'+img+'.webp'} alt={t} width="900" height="600" loading="lazy"/><figcaption><strong>{t}</strong><span>{d}</span></figcaption></figure>)}</div></section>

<section class="wrap section jc-about"><figure><img src="/jewellery-consultation/venkat-founder.webp" alt="Venkat, Founder, Canny Heads Consulting" width="325" height="340" loading="lazy"/><figcaption class="jc-founder"><strong>Venkat</strong><span>Founder & CEO, Canny Heads Consulting</span></figcaption></figure><div><p class="kicker">About · Why us</p><h2>Real experience from the showroom floor.</h2><p>Led by our founder <b>Venkat</b>, a retail business leader with an MBA in Retail Management who has worked with leading corporate jewellery showrooms. For more than 20 years we have worked inside jewellery retail: opening stores, hiring and training sales teams, running daily operations and growing sales. This is practical advice from people who have done the job, not theory.</p><ul class="jc-why"><li><b>End-to-end:</b> one partner from choosing the location to running the store every day.</li><li><b>Jewellery-specific:</b> product knowledge, selling, merchandise and compliance made for jewellery retail.</li><li><b>Hands-on:</b> we set up the systems, train your people and stay with you after the launch.</li><li><b>Connected:</b> recruitment through GetJobMe, gold appraiser training through PrimeGold Academy and your online store on BigShopes.</li></ul><p class="small">Offices in Thanjavur and Coimbatore, Tamil Nadu.</p></div></section>

<section id="jc-enquiry" class="jc-cta"><div class="wrap jc-split"><div><p class="kicker">Start the conversation</p><h2>Planning a new showroom or growing an existing one?</h2><p>Tell us a little about your business. We will call you back to understand your needs.</p><p class="jc-contact"><a href={wa}>WhatsApp 72008 24009 ↗</a><a href="tel:+917200824009">Call +91 72008 24009</a><a href="tel:+919500936499">Call +91 95009 36499</a><a href="mailto:info@cannyheads.com?subject=Jewellery%20business%20consultation">info@cannyheads.com</a></p></div><form class="jc-form" data-jc-form><label>Your name<input name="name" required autocomplete="name"/></label><label>Mobile number<input name="mobile" required inputmode="tel" autocomplete="tel" pattern="[0-9+ ]{10,15}"/></label><label>Showroom name & city<input name="business" required/></label><label>You are<select name="stage"><option>Planning a new jewellery showroom</option><option>Running a jewellery showroom</option></select></label><label>What do you need help with? (optional)<textarea name="message" rows="3"></textarea></label><button class="button" type="submit">Send enquiry on WhatsApp ↗</button><p class="small">Opens WhatsApp with your details filled in. Just press send.</p></form></div></section>
<script is:inline src="/jewellery-consultation.js" defer></script>
